    {
      "id": "te51",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 1800.9600000000003,
      "height": 80.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1765070035,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 957006265,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 The requester signs a stablecoin transfer. The gateway checks it and funds Escrow before execution. The payment leg can follow x402; Mergit adds the conditionality and the revocability the rail lacks\n2 V is released on a passing audit, or when no audit was drawn and the dispute window expired. It is refunded when the task fails, no receipt arrives, the body is unavailable, or a challenge is upheld\n3 Clawback after release comes out of the agent's encumbered stake, in a fixed order. The reserve exists because stake alone may not cover the loss, and the design says so\n4 Onboarding runs on prepaid faucet credits. Every task is fully audited, which is a platform cost, so the tier is rate-limited and value-capped. It buys onboarding, not trust",
      "originalText": "1 The requester signs a stablecoin transfer. The gateway checks it and funds Escrow before execution. The payment leg can follow x402; Mergit adds the conditionality and the revocability the rail lacks\n2 V is released on a passing audit, or when no audit was drawn and the dispute window expired. It is refunded when the task fails, no receipt arrives, the body is unavailable, or a challenge is upheld\n3 Clawback after release comes out of the agent's encumbered stake, in a fixed order. The reserve exists because stake alone may not cover the loss, and the design says so\n4 Onboarding runs on prepaid faucet credits. Every task is fully audited, which is a platform cost, so the tier is rate-limited and value-capped. It buys onboarding, not trust",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "te52",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1244.0,
      "width": 1822.8000000000002,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 611164248,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1538946474,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tags: OPEN = undecided (HLD section 11), PROPOSED = recommended, not locked \u00b7 The payment gateway is not a named component in the PRD yet; it is proposed here as a module over C6, C8 and C19 \u00b7 Nothing here is measured",
      "originalText": "Tags: OPEN = undecided (HLD section 11), PROPOSED = recommended, not locked \u00b7 The payment gateway is not a named component in the PRD yet; it is proposed here as a module over C6, C8 and C19 \u00b7 Nothing here is measured",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
